{
    "prompt": "Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes. If object found, approach and grab it. Then move to destination and perform task. Else, if obstacle detected, avoid it. Finally, scan area for objects. list of available nodes: <Action ID = ApproachObject    /> <Action ID = GrabObject    /> <Action ID = MoveToDestination    /> <Action ID = PerformTask    /> <Action ID = AvoidObstacle    /> <Action ID = ScanAreaForObjects    />  <Condition ID = IsObjectFound    /> <Condition ID = IsObstacleDetected    />",
